This project integrates, at arm's length over ComfyUI's HTTP/WebSocket API, the following third-party work:

Idol (speridlabs) — https://github.com/speridlabs/idol-sdk
  Model architecture (TripoSplat by VAST) and weights, Apache License 2.0.
  Copyright speridlabs. The converted weights are published by PedroMarinhoDev.

ComfyUI-Idol — https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-Idol (commit 59ed4b4)
  GPL-3.0. Adds Idol Preprocess Image, Idol Input Camera and Idol Precision on ComfyUI's native
  TripoSplat nodes. Installed inside the GPU worker container, unmodified.

ComfyUI — https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI (v0.43.0)
  GPL-3.0. Inference runtime and 3D/Gaussian-splat nodes.

Model files downloaded by the worker keep their own licences:
  * Idol / Idol VAE decoder (PedroMarinhoDev/Idol-ComfyUI): Apache-2.0
  * DINOv3 ViT-H (Meta, via VAST-AI/TripoSplat): DINOv3 License
  * FLUX.2 VAE (Black Forest Labs, via VAST-AI/TripoSplat): see the model card
  * BiRefNet (Comfy-Org repack): MIT

Frontend/backend dependencies:
  * Three.js — MIT
  * @mkkellogg/gaussian-splats-3d — MIT
  * React, Vite, Tailwind CSS, FastAPI, Starlette, Pillow, httpx, uvicorn — MIT/BSD/Apache-2.0 as per their
    respective licences.

The development simulator (tools/simulate_comfy.py) is original code in this repository. It does not run
Idol and must not be presented as inference output.
